{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-036",
    "title": "：天门之下"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_219",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "太虚秩序启动，试图将所有灵脉重新接回世界。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟盟总坛在回川城西南的断崖下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6502,
          "end": 6502
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三人沿山腹石道走了一整夜，才抵达一座被雪覆盖的石门。石门没有守卫，门楣上却刻着一行旧字：改写者先改自己。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6504,
          "end": 6504
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将白色骨牌嵌进门缝。石门向内开启，露出一间空旷的石厅。石厅中央悬着一座黑色水池，池水没有波纹，池面却倒映着不同年代的天空。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6506,
          "end": 6506
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是归墟盟的归名池。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6508,
          "end": 6508
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“用来做什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6510,
          "end": 6510
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“检查名字是否仍属于本人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6512,
          "end": 6512
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走到池边。池面浮出他的倒影，倒影却没有脸，只有一团青色火焰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6514,
          "end": 6514
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字已经部分进入天门。”慧闻的声音从石厅入口传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6516,
          "end": 6516
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜回头：“你也来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6518,
          "end": 6518
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无相寺不放心你们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6520,
          "end": 6520
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还是不放心归墟盟？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6522,
          "end": 6522
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“两者相同。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6524,
          "end": 6524
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临越往前走，记忆越沉。他看见自己的倒影从水面裂开，裂缝里露出陆沉舟的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6550,
          "end": 6550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要结丹。”陆沉舟说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6552,
          "end": 6552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已借壳筑基，正在冲击金丹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6554,
          "end": 6554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉会替你跨过境界。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6556,
          "end": 6556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6558,
          "end": 6558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6560,
          "end": 6560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我想听你说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6562,
          "end": 6562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟伸手按在水面：“每一次借用门的力量，你都会失去一段只属于自己的记忆。不是名字，不是历史，而是让你成为你的那一小部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6564,
          "end": 6564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我会变成什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6566,
          "end": 6566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个记得所有人，却不记得自己为何记得的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6568,
          "end": 6568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "池水突然沸腾。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6570,
          "end": 6570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的气海中，金色裂纹彻底合拢，凝成一枚暗金色的丹丸。丹丸外侧缠着青色纹路，像一扇缩小的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6572,
          "end": 6572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主抬手：“金丹成了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6574,
          "end": 6574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到池边：“他还没准备好！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6576,
          "end": 6576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有人准备好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6578,
          "end": 6578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临从池中走出，衣袍滴水未沾。掌心残印已经与两枚石片融合，形成一枚不完整的灰白圆盘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6580,
          "end": 6580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我结丹了。”他低声说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6582,
          "end": 6582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得自己为什么要结丹吗？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6584,
          "end": 6584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头，想起父亲、顾长离、叶观澜和回川城的居民。他知道自己必须变强，却想不起最初那个让他踏上玄霄宗山道的念头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6586,
          "end": 6586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为了找一个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6588,
          "end": 6588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6590,
          "end": 6590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6592,
          "end": 6592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他知道答案，却无法把名字说出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6594,
          "end": 6594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抓住他的手：“是陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6596,
          "end": 6596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名字被她说出，暗金丹丸立刻震动。陆照临胸口一阵剧痛，记忆中那张父亲的脸再次变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6598,
          "end": 6598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得。”他说，“只是不能自己说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6600,
          "end": 6600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主将一块黑色令牌递给他：“金丹之后，你可以进入总坛内层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6602,
          "end": 6602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不为归墟盟做事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6604,
          "end": 6604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不需要为任何人做事。你只需要看见改写权的源头。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6606,
          "end": 6606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "内层石门打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6608,
          "end": 6608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "墙壁上挂着数百份旧盟约，纸张被分成两半，一半写着允许记住的名字，一半写着必须忘记的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6610,
          "end": 6610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走到最里面，取下一份残缺盟约。盟约上写着他的祖辈名字，旁边盖着盟主印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6612,
          "end": 6612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你早知道自己的家族参与撕名？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6614,
          "end": 6614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6616,
          "end": 6616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么没说？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6618,
          "end": 6618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为我不确定自己是在追查罪，还是在继承罪。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6620,
          "end": 6620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走到他们身后：“所有人都在继承。玄霄宗继承守门，无相寺继承记录，顾氏继承债，归墟盟继承改写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6622,
          "end": 6622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6684,
          "end": 6684
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "再往下，是顾氏旁支一串被削掉的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6718,
          "end": 6718
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里保存的是所有被放弃的名字？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6720,
          "end": 6720
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是保存。”慧闻说，“是等待归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6722,
          "end": 6722
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟主：“你早知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6724,
          "end": 6724
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道总坛下面有门，不知道门后是名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6726,
          "end": 6726
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "阶梯尽头是一片巨大的地下空洞。空洞中央悬着一座倒置的城，城墙向下，街道向上，所有屋舍都由灰白色石片拼成。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6728,
          "end": 6728
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是回川城？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6730,
          "end": 6730
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前的回川城。”慧闻答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6732,
          "end": 6732
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城门上方没有匾额，只有一道尚未闭合的裂缝。裂缝与天门天空中的裂缝完全相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6734,
          "end": 6734
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧灾不是从灵脉城开始。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6736,
          "end": 6736
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也不是从天门开始。”陆照临补充。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6738,
          "end": 6738
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走到倒置城下，抬手触碰一块石片。石片立即显现出一段影像：三百年前，北境各州灵脉同时逆流，山川倒悬，凡人失去昨日，修士失去姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6740,
          "end": 6740
        }
      }
    ],
